@startuml
title KTOB — Backend Package Dependency Rules (conceptual)
package "api" as API
package "security" as Security
package "reader" as Reader
package "library" as Library
package "catalog" as Catalog
package "advisor" as Advisor
package "acquisition" as Acquisition
package "integration" as Integration
package "shared contracts" as Shared
API ..> Security
API ..> Reader
API ..> Library
API ..> Catalog
API ..> Advisor
API ..> Acquisition
Reader ..> Shared
Library ..> Reader : identity / permissions
Library ..> Catalog : work identity
Advisor ..> Reader : allowed context
Advisor ..> Library : selected history
Advisor ..> Catalog : suggested works
Acquisition ..> Catalog : work/edition
Catalog ..> Integration : book metadata
Advisor ..> Integration : AI provider
Acquisition ..> Integration : external offers (TBD)
Integration ..> Shared
note bottom
Dependencies express contracts, not shared mutable state.
Business modules remain logical modules in one Spring Boot deployment.
Avoid circular module dependencies during implementation.
end note
@enduml
